{"item_id":"feed:https://soldiersystems.net/2026/10/15/tacjobs-buyer-planner-tech-support-rep-at-lumenier/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=tacjobs-buyer-planner-tech-support-rep-at-lumenier","version_id":"ef1481fb07b81eee545381321416edecca9bd8e71686e8772d035efe0aae05b1","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this Lumenier recruitment notice offers no in-scope gear evidence or Mammoth application. Its commercial purpose is recruiting employees, with only an application link supplied.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://soldiersystems.net/2026/10/15/av-and-thunder-tiger-sign-mou-to-explore-uncrewed-systems-integration-and-co-production-in-taiwan/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=av-and-thunder-tiger-sign-mou-to-explore-uncrewed-systems-integration-and-co-production-in-taiwan","version_id":"bd2c457a0ef5a89d56c6be5ee194117c4a222de570c73620862150b7fe74cd2d","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, proposed military uncrewed-platform integration and co-production are outside the competitor gear categories and unconnected to Mammoth. Under Commercial incentives, this is an AV/Thunder Tiger corporate announcement featuring company executives' promotional claims.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://soldiersystems.net/2026/10/15/springfield-armory-announces-launch-of-echelon-pro-9mm-pistols/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=springfield-armory-announces-launch-of-echelon-pro-9mm-pistols","version_id":"3817723344efb197629cd7aea2da202413b1fc7e5fcf57cf6283d1671fcaeb1e","decision":"reject","reason":"Exclusions and Making the decision rule out this firearm launch covering Echelon Pro Comp pistols, magazines and grip features. Under Commercial incentives, the text is Springfield Armory's promotional release, including its marketing executive's praise and product pricing.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/federal-ballistic-ae-app-update-puts-data-on-one-screen/","version_id":"9deea7eef1c4dcd408ad70e945d0e3ff7eba014d6687b34eb785b162d2114a1d","decision":"accept","reason":"Under Relevance, Freshness and novelty, and Credibility, the newly announced combined HUD/DOPE workspace and manual wind/range controls provide specific manufacturer-reported changes relevant to field ballistic calculations, supporting Piece 01. Under Commercial incentives and Uncertainty, SSUSA's announcement-based account and Federal marketing quotation supply no independent testing, so faster operation, offline reliability and improved accuracy remain unverified claims.","piece_ids":["01"]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/new-for-2026-hornady-reloading-products/","version_id":"545badd2a4a5e075c546f836d65797a8006646a0a1df2f75f15c8afbaede28e8","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this roundup concerns reloading presses, bench accessories, brass and dies rather than eligible gear carried at Mammoth; the blower's incidental rangefinder-cleaning claim does not establish field suitability. Under Commercial incentives, the account promotes Hornady's lineup and repeats its unsupported equipment-safety claim.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/new-zerotech-trace-x-5-25x-56-mm-ffp-rmg-h-mrad-illuminated-riflescope/","version_id":"98f3c98af16fe529540d91bc3d44221beff8fee0e5b5a82876d3a97b7f847e78","decision":"accept","reason":"Under Relevance, Credibility, and Freshness and novelty, this new riflescope's claimed 31.5-ounce weight, 5–25X magnification, 34-MRAD elevation travel and $899 list price provide concrete specifications for Piece 01's introduction and Piece 03's carry-weight and cost tradeoffs. Under Commercial incentives and Uncertainty, SSUSA supplies manufacturer-derived information without independent testing, so the IPX7 rating, zero-stop operation and field performance must remain attributed rather than treated as verified.","piece_ids":["01","03"]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/beretta-and-la-vallee-build-a-shotgun-you-can-see-into/","version_id":"833d641d9680793c49b9957f8a42d7385bb06b6bcf4e445873287bb7e9eaf8b7","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Exclusions, Relevance, and Making the decision, this account of a one-off SO10 shotgun and its sapphire-windowed mechanism is excluded firearm content without a Mammoth gear application. Under Commercial incentives, it showcases Beretta and La Vallée's anniversary collaboration through company representatives' claims.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/chad-heckler-wins-limited-title-at-2026-iprf-world-championship/","version_id":"9f0872a9bab816533d55c42788bbc9e9f55a33dba2a4025220cb479dc1ac5562","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this championship-results report provides no substantive evaluation of eligible gear under Mammoth conditions; naming a Leupold scope does not establish its performance. Under Commercial incentives, Heckler's Team Vihtavuori relationship and ownership of the rifle-building shop are disclosed, and his score cannot independently validate individual equipment claims.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/new-springfield-armory-echelon-pro-9-mm-pistols/","version_id":"74d21b7b482d61183fc5116c9fe54d9f879019e151a64ef63f9558f820d76de3","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Exclusions and Making the decision, this Echelon Pro Comp pistol introduction is excluded firearm content, including discussion of compensators, barrels and grip modules. Under Commercial incentives, SSUSA's product announcement presents Springfield's features and pricing without documented independent testing.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/2026-ipsc-shotgun-world-shoot-u-s-women-s-results/","version_id":"80a88ebf7fe4eecd81de464dffa577db460b855697964585ec172852bd5532c8","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this shotgun championship-results report offers no specific evidence about eligible gear's suitability for Mammoth. Under Commercial incentives, it identifies Fiocchi team members, a Smith & Wesson ambassador, a Benelli pro staff shooter and a Team Winchester athlete, but those affiliations and their results provide no relevant gear testing.","piece_ids":[]}
